# One spelling of every text file on every platform: templates and goldens
# are compared byte for byte, and packages digest the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# A vendored licence, kept exactly as its authors wrote it.
web/app/fonts/OFL.txt -text

# A declared extension's component: a `<view>` block and a `<script>` block.
# GitHub highlights it as KDL, the grammar the view is written in: most
# components are a view alone, and Vue's grammar leaves an unknown `<view>`
# block plain text. The script, Rhai, keeps its strings, numbers and
# comments under KDL. `.uze` files stay out of the repository's language
# statistics: they are examples and fixtures.
*.uze linguist-language=KDL linguist-documentation
